  "aboutBody": "BabyBloom is an app that helps parents in Sri Lanka track their child's health records and receive vaccine reminders based on the official MOH (Ministry of Health) immunization schedule.\n\nThe app allows you to keep track of your baby's growth, vaccination progress, mother's health details, and important emergency contacts — all in one place, right on your phone.",
